n pin 22 would not work.\", \"confidence\": 0.55}], \"summary\": \"The design files mostly match the specification, but R12 (0 \u03a9) connects the PWM2 servo signal net to the GND net through bus pin 22. This contradicts the spec's pin 20/22 ch.2 mapping and would short the channel-2 signal to ground if populated.\"}",
